<title>HONG KONG: HK Jan provisional trade deficit HK$12.4 bln.</title>
<headline>HK Jan provisional trade deficit HK$12.4 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department released the following data showing a provisional visible trade deficit of HK$12.4 billion in January (rounded figures in billions of H.K. dollars):</p>
<p>			    Jan '97	Dec '96	 Jan '96</p>
<p> Trade balance	  -12.4	  -14.75	  -10.09</p>
<p> Domestic Exports	17.3	   18.22	   18.99</p>
<p> Re-exports	     102.1	   98.45	  101.19</p>
<p> Total exports	  119.4	  116.66	  120.19</p>
<p> Imports		  131.8	  131.41	  130.28</p>
<p>Cumulative figures for year-ended:</p>
<p>			    Jan '97	Dec '96	 Jan '96</p>
<p> Trade balance	 -139.96	 -137.66	  -153.46</p>
<p> Domestic Exports     210.44	  212.16	   232.47</p>
<p> Re-exports	   1,186.67	1,185.76	 1,130.52</p>
<p> Total exports	1,397.11	1,397.92	 1,362.99</p>
<p> Imports		1,537.07	1,535.58	 1,516.46</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
